/-!
# A056023

The positive integers written as a triangle, where row n is written from right to left if n is odd and otherwise from left to right.

The 66 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A056023

